  "reason": "The new gates are diagnostic-only, reviewed against artifacts, and separate root impact from whole-game transfer. Root impact passed, but H2H transfer and attribution are not promotable: local search scores look better while duplicate-swapped confidence remains negative, and the pair-level consistency analyzer shows local gains do not predict H2H deltas. The search-guided scorer-continuation smoke also failed correlation, so the next action is trajectory-level search-as-policy improvement or continuation-calibrated search/value learning, not Slumbot.",
